Significance: minor
Type: added

The event list query, `Event\Query::get_events_list()`, now takes an arguments array instead of positional parameters, and a new `gatherpress_events_list_query_args` filter runs over the final `WP_Query` args. Code calling it with positional arguments needs to pass an array. Plugins can add meta constraints, extra taxonomies, or custom ordering to the upcoming and past event lists without replacing the whole method, which is what a location filter needs now that venues carry latitude and longitude.
